codex
The code and test patch is in place within the allowed directory. The updated old expectation now treats `cacheRead: 0` as priced; the same lookup test retains missing-rate coverage and adds the negative-rate control, while the new direct-path test verifies zero cost, uncached cost, baseline, and rendered savings without calling registry fallback. I’m running the focused suite before the full package gate.
